            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Edward Bernays and Public Relations</strong><br>\nEdward Bernays, born in 1891, was an influential figure in the development of the public relations (PR) profession. Known as the \"Father of Public Relations,\" Bernays was the first to apply psychology and other social sciences to the practice of PR. He believed that public opinion could be shaped and manipulated, a controversial idea at the time. Bernays used his unique approach to run successful campaigns for various clients, including major corporations and the U.S. government.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Early Life and Education</strong><br>\nBernays was the nephew of Sigmund Freud, the father of psychoanalysis, which influenced his understanding of the human psyche. Growing up, Bernays was exposed to his uncle's ideas, which would later shape his career in PR. He attended Cornell University, where he studied agriculture, but he found his calling in journalism and shifted his focus to writing and the influence of media.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Pioneering Public Relations</strong><br>\nAfter World War I, Bernays started his own PR firm and began to lay the groundwork for the profession. He crafted his techniques based on the idea that mass psychology could guide public opinion. Bernays's methods included using third-party authorities to sway public perception and staging events to attract media coverage.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
